# RAPIDO Firmware — BLE Wireless Command Protocol

Firmware source code for the RAPIDO wireless optofluidic 
neuromodulation system, as described in:

> [Eun Young Jeong†, Jong Woo Park†, Sungwoo Cho, Donggi Han, Choong Yeon Kim, Sung Woo Kim, Wonhee Lee, Wha Young Kim*, Jeong-Hoon Kim*, Jae-Woong Jeong*]. 
> IoT-enabled wireless neural implant for chronic, programmable neuropharmacology and optogenetics. 
> *Science Advances* (in revision).

## Hardware
- SoC module: EYSHSNZWZ (Taiyo Yuden, nRF52840)

## Build environment
- Nordic nRF5 SDK v15.3.0
- SoftDevice S140 v6.1.1
- Segger Embedded Studio v5.x

## Dependencies
`ble_cus.c/.h`, `ble_cus_c.c/.h`, `pin_mapping.h` and all 
other SDK files are not included. The nRF5 SDK can be downloaded 
from https://www.nordicsemi.com/Products/Development-software/nRF5-SDK

